  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Legendary cross-trainer originally worn by Deion Sanders\nMid-cut silhouette with a leather and synthetic upper for lasting support\nBold Swoosh and Nike Air detailing throughout brings signature attitude\nMesh windows in the upper stay true to the original ’90s design\nLace closure and adjustable midfoot strap ensure a secure fit\nVisible Air-Sole unit in the heel for responsive cushioning\nRubber outsole with traction pattern for grip across surfaces\nThe Nike Air Diamond Turf 2 is imported.\nIt's always Prime Time when you lace up Men's Nike Air Diamond Turf 2 Casual Shoes. The era-defining cross trainer, designed to fuel Deion Sanders' electrifying runs on both the football field and the baseball diamond, returns with its unmistakable ’90s swagger. A sneakerhead favorite, the Air Diamond Turf 2 is your ticket to head-turning style and legendary attitude, on or off the field.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Air Diamond Turf 2 Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Sail/Mystic Navy/Blue Grey/Metallic Gold</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3478435</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px